    {
      "text": "**`variety of different kinds of data, including the following:`**\n1. Booleans\n2. Numbers\n3. Strings\n4. Dates and timestamps\n5. Handling null\n6. Complex types\n7. User-defined functions\n\n\n*submodule of org.apache.spark.sql  has many functions to work with data sets*\n<a href=\"https://spark.apache.org/docs/latest/api/scala/index.html?search=functions\">latest doc</a>\n\n1. class DataFrameNaFunctions extends AnyRef\n2. class DataFrameStatFunctions extends AnyRef\n3. object Functions <a href=\"https://github.com/apache/spark/blob/v3.5.0/sql/core/src/main/scala/org/apache/spark/sql/functions.scala\">org.apache.spark.sql.functions</a>\n",
      "config": {
        "colWidth": 12,
        "fontSize": 9,
        "enabled": true,
        "editorMode": "ace/mode/markdown",
        "editorSetting": {
          "params": {},
          "forms": {},
