      "id": "fec43ddd53ed4c9dada9f"
    },
    {
      "text": "#### Working with date and times\n\n`we often store our timestamps or dates as strings and convert them into date types at\nruntime.`\n\n1. current_date()\n2. current_timestamp()\n3. to_date(col(date),\"yyyy-MM-dd\")  or to_date(col(date))\n4. to_timestamp(col(date), \"yyyy-mm-dd\")  0r to_timestamp(col(date))\n\n[SET timzone](https://spark.apache.org/docs/latest/sql-ref-syntax-aux-conf-mgmt-set-timezone.html)\n\n[Java simpledataformat](https://docs.oracle.com/javase/8/docs/api/java/text/SimpleDateFormat.html)\n```\nNote:\n=>When it\ncomes to timezone handling. In version 2.1 and before, Spark parsed according to the machine’s\ntimezone if timezones are not explicitly specified in the value that you are parsing. You can set a\nsession local timezone if necessary by setting spark.conf.session.timeZone in the SQL\nconfigurations. This should be set according to the Java TimeZone format\n\n=> Spark will not throw an error if it cannot parse the date; rather, it will just return null\n```\n\n\n---\n\n>Unix time is also known as Epoch time which specifies the moment in time since 1970-01-01 00:00:00 UTC\n\n\n5. unix_timestamp(): is used to get the current time and to convert the time string in a format yyyy-MM-dd HH:mm:ss to Unix timestamp (in seconds) and\n     1) def unix_timestamp()\n     2) def unix_timestamp(s: Column)\n     3) def unix_timestamp(s: Column, p: String) \n6. from_unixtime():  Converts Unix Time Seconds to Date and Timestamp\n    1) def from_unixtime(ut: Column): Column\n    2) def from_unixtime(ut: Column, f: String): Column\n\n \n",
      "config": {
        "colWidth": 12,
        "fontSize": 9,
        "enabled": true,
        "editorMode": "ace/mode/markdown",
        "editorSetting": {
          "params": {},
          "forms": {},
          "language": "markdown",
          "editOnDblClick": false,
          "completionKey": "TAB",
          "completionSupport": true
        }
      },
      "settings": {
        "params": {},
        "forms": {}
      },
      "id": "2e2bd20f9eba413bb026c"
    },
